json","responseBody":"{\n  \"ok\": \"false\"\n}"},"position":[96,288],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","typeVersion":1.4},{"id":"e5d78a9d-74cf-494f-9057-d2de3a8d0691","name":"Sticky Note1","parameters":{"color":7,"content":"## Creation  \n## Webhook input\n\nReceives name, surname, course and email via HTTP POST on `/certifications`.  \nStarts the certificate creation flow.\n","height":368,"width":256},"position":[-672,-448],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"id":"bb676994-7df9-4873-b260-8086c74ad6b1","name":"Sticky Note2","parameters":{"color":7,"content":"## Creation – Generate & validate ID\n\nGenerates a random CertificationID, checks the Data Table for duplicates and only continues when the ID is unique.  \nIf the ID already exists, the flow loops until a free one is found.\n","height":368,"width":864},"position":[-400,-448],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"id":"b876bfd4-fd59-49ca-9386-9a55cd754a78","name":"Sticky Note4","parameters":{"color":7,"content":"## Creation – Save, PDF & email\n\nSaves the learner record with the CertificationID to the Data Table, generates the certificate PDF from an HTML template and emails it to the learner.\n","height":368,"width":448},"position":[480,-448],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"id":"80d9e416-5bde-4845-948d-f08ad893b737","name":"Sticky Note6","parameters":{"color":7,"content":"## Check – Webhook input\n\nReceives a CertificationID via HTTP POST on `/certificationscheck` and starts the verification flow.\n","height":320,"width":256},"position":[-672,32],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"id":"3e2d8f20-4f2c-4f9a-9948-455886e62039","name":"Webhook_Creation","parameters":{"httpMethod":"POST","options":{},"path":"certifications2","responseMode":"lastNode"},"position":[-592,-240],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","typeVersion":2.1,"webhookId":"9e899529-884a-4bf9-872a-34ca89c3621d"},{"id":"3adee942-b0b4-4bec-adaa-fe5bddc60f2d","name":"Sticky Note7","parameters":{"color":7,"content":"## Check – Look up ID\n\nSearches the Certifications Data Table for the submitted CertificationID and branches depending on whether a matching record exists.\n","height":320,"width":432},"position":[-400,32],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"id":"cf2f8732-9ee6-4f3a-9022-836d788d66ce","name":"Sticky Note8","parameters":{"color":7,"content":"## Check – Responses\n\nReturns JSON to the caller.  \nIf the ID is found: `ok: true` plus name and surname.  \nIf not found: `ok: false` so the client can show an “invalid certification” message.\n","height":176,"width":432},"position":[272,176],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"id":"338fc6e8-eb2e-4801-8a89-b4d8f35f86f2","name":"Sticky Note10","parameters":{"content":"## Certifications – Creator & Checker\n\n## How it works\nThis workflow manages the full lifecycle of a training certificate.  \n`/certifications` receives learner details, generates a unique CertificationID and checks that it does not exist yet.  \nIf the ID is free, the workflow stores the record, builds a PDF certificate and emails it to the learner.  \n\n`/certificationscheck` lets you verify a certificate later.  \nThe webhook receives a CertificationID, looks it up in the same Data Table and returns a simple JSON response that frontends or other services can use to show “valid” or “not found”.\n\n## Setup steps\n1. Create a Data Table (e.g. **Certifications**) with Name, Surname, CertificationID and any extra fields.\n2. Configure the PDF Generator node with your account API and adjust the HTML template to your branding.\n3. Connect your email account (Gmail/SMTP) in **Email_Certification**.\n4. Deploy the `/certifications` and `/certificationscheck` webhooks and use their public URLs.\n5. Test creation and verification with a few sample requests before going live.\n","height":560,"width":640},"position":[-1344,-448],"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1},{"credentials":{"pdfGeneratorApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"pdfGeneratorApi Credential"}},"id":"33d6d124-643b-4cb5-b7bc-a78266aaefec","name":"Generate a PDF document","parameters":{"additionalFields":{},"data":"={\n  \"DueDate\": \"{{$now.toISODate()}}\",\n  \"Candidate\": \"{{$('Webhook_Creation').item.json.headers.name}} {{$('Webhook_Creation').item.json.headers.surname}}\",\n  \"CourseName\": \"{{ $('Webhook_Creation').item.json.headers.course }}\",\n  \"ID\": \"{{ $('Generate_Certification_ID').item.json.id }}\"\n}","documentOutput":"file","templateId":{"__rl":true,"cachedResultName":"Certificate Example (ID: 1560735)","mode":"list","value":"1560735"}},"position":[544,-224],"type":"@pdfgeneratorapi/n8n-nodes-pdf-generator-api.pdfGeneratorApi","typeVersion":1}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"tags":[{"createdAt":"2025-11-23T13:34:14.752Z","id":"DNVBijE9cEya3mqW","name":"PROD","updatedAt":"2025-11-23T13:34:14.752Z"},{"createdAt":"2025-11-23T13:36:13.729Z","id":"T2GE36JapoXlWhjo","name":"creator-published","updatedAt":"2025-11-23T13:36:13.729Z"}],"versionId":"27c846c4-3476-4aaa-b81d-19c93a130da0"}
